    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰμ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴμη</span>)
		only fut. and aor., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swoop</i> or <i>pounce upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴμησεν δὲ ἀλεὶς ὥς τ᾽ αἰετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.308
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				311
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκος . . οἴμησε μετὰ τρήρωνα
				πέλειαν</span>
			<i>swooped</i> after a dove, ib.<i><span class="en">
				140
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>dart along,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύννοι δ᾽ οἰμήσουσι</span> Orac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.62
			</span></i>.</div>
